be a student right now, and am not able to give much--for now.

I am in no way rich, but I do donate well to causes I support. This includes
Lojban and singinst.org. I've had my donations backfire severely, with people
banning me even after I donate. I trust Lojban and singinst.org to be above
board with money. I trust Robin personally to put money to good use.

